# <extension_sql_name>

This target is a PostgreSQL extension built with pgrx. Copy and customize
`Dockerfile.tmpl` into this target directory, then add `metadata.hcl` with
`build_system = "pgrx"`.

The Dockerfile must retain a commit-pinned GitHub archive URL, the locked Cargo
metadata preflight, CycloneDX and cargo-about commands, normalized runtime
payload, and the named `pgrx-sbom` stage. Source release/tool versions belong
in the Dockerfile; the catalog/image source version belongs in metadata and is
kept synchronized with the Renovate tag comment.

Run the focused pgrx checks and the local caller workflow before submitting a
target. Explain package-specific non-free licensing questions in the issue or
pull request; do not add a source-controlled license-review artifact.
